WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.175
Look at the tower,

2
00:00:01.175 --> 00:00:02.223
and you can tell where

3
00:00:02.223 --> 00:00:03.467
a temple comes from.

4
00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:04.936
Curved in the north.

5
00:00:04.936 --> 00:00:06.408
Stepped like a pyramid in

6
00:00:06.408 --> 00:00:07.549
the south.

7
00:00:07.876 --> 00:00:09.442
Nagara temples have a curving

8
00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.132
tower called the shikhara.

9
00:00:11.132 --> 00:00:12.549
They usually sit on a

10
00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:13.678
raised platform,

11
00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:16.301
often without big boundary walls.

12
00:00:16.631 --> 00:00:18.146
Dravida temples have a stepped

13
00:00:18.146 --> 00:00:19.662
tower called the vimana.

14
00:00:19.662 --> 00:00:21.503
And a walled compound entered

15
00:00:21.503 --> 00:00:24.353
through tall gateways called gopurams.

16
00:00:24.696 --> 00:00:26.973
The Kandariya Mahadeva temple at

17
00:00:26.973 --> 00:00:28.692
Khajuraho is Nagara.

18
00:00:28.692 --> 00:00:31.600
The Brihadeeswarar temple at Thanjavur,

19
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.682
built under Rajaraja Chola,

20
00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:35.031
is Dravida.

21
00:00:35.725 --> 00:00:36.896
Your turn.

22
00:00:36.896 --> 00:00:38.912
What is a gopuram?
